item.description:
The City of Milton solicited sealed bids from qualified, licensed general contractors for the construction of the Blackwater Riverwalk South Extension project. The solicitation requested unit-price bids for two alternative and mutually exclusive boardwalk configurations for the same Project, as described:
Bid Schedule A – the purchase, construction, and installation of three hundred forty (340) Linear Feet (LF) of seventeen feet five inches (17’-5”)-wide boardwalk extension;
Bid Schedule B – the purchase, construction, and installation of five hundred fifty (550) Linear Feet (LF) of twelve foot (12’)-wide boardwalk extension. The City will select and award only one configuration. Bidders shall submit complete pricing for both Bid Schedule A and Bid Schedule B.

